      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "split:  d_i = \u03bb\u00b7n\u00b7(f/n)^(i/N) + (1\u2212\u03bb)\u00b7(n + (f\u2212n)\u00b7i/N)     (Zhang practical scheme, \u03bb = csmLambda = 0.7)\nselect: fragment picks first cascade whose cascadeSplits[i] \u2265 its view-space forward depth  \u2212(V\u00b7p).z",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
