      "text": "Per-cascade light view-proj",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "seed": 4000025,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4500025,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1735000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "text-4000025",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 485,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 94,
      "strokeColor": "#862e9c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "computeCascades() (per frame):\n unproject frustum corners for\n [d_{i-1}, d_i], bounding-sphere fit\n \u2192 stable square ortho (radius\u00b2)\n cascadeViewProj[i]: world \u2192 slice [0,1] clip\n GLM_FORCE_DEPTH_ZERO_TO_ONE",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "seed": 4000026,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4500026,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1735000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "text-4000026",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 470,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 44,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "lighting.frag samples one sampler2D and remaps into the slice:  atlasU = (c + uv.x)/N,\nclamped within the slice so 3\u00d73 PCF can't bleed across cascades.  No texture arrays / per-layer views.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
